{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208380","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208380","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320838001:1":{"text":"嚯嚯，你们果然在这里。","source_cn":"嚯嚯，你们果然在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39C9C169C9586809","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320838002:1":{"text":"我很想知道，是什么原因让你们变更了原定计划上的路线。","source_cn":"我很想知道，是什么原因让你们变更了原定计划上的路线。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E3689F42F3CE9DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320838003:1":{"text":"呼金老师，你不是去检查冰雕情况了吗，怎么来了？","source_cn":"呼金老师，你不是去检查冰雕情况了吗，怎么来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F76258D5F87B1B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320838004:1":{"text":"我顺便检查了所有的产线，无论工作态度，还是对流程的处理都一塌糊涂！","source_cn":"我顺便检查了所有的产线，无论工作态度，还是对流程的处理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FD762ACD4B32822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320838005:1":{"text":"这么多人中只有你们没有按照原本的计划进行，变更了运输路线，为什么？","source_cn":"这么多人中只有你们没有按照原本的计划进行，变更了运输路...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x524E5DED93ADE4AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_c